# PR test coverage gate

Before merging or pushing a PR into `main`:

1. Run `npm test` and `npx tsc --noEmit` — both must pass.
2. For every logic/behavior change in the PR, confirm there is matching coverage in `src/*.test.ts` (existing or new). Pure docs/copy/metadata-only PRs do not need new tests, but still must pass the suite.
3. If behavior changed without tests, add or update tests first — do not merge until covered.
4. In the merge summary, briefly note what was tested (or that the PR was docs-only).
